Package: BayesComp
Title: Computational Companion for STA5001
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Sheng", "Jiang", email = "jiangsheng@cuhk.edu.cn",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Data and reusable computations for STA5001 Bayesian and
    Computational Statistics. Includes a quadrature benchmark for the
    hierarchical Gaussian school-means model.
